  "body": "## Summary\n\n`create_backup`\n  reject passphrases shorter than the shared 8-byte minimum before encryption\n  retain weak-passphrase advisories for accepted inputs\n\nThe `id key export` CLI now uses the same constant.\n\nFixes #8943\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** `create_backup` passed every byte slice directly to `key_envelope::encrypt`; the CLI alone enforced an 8-byte minimum.\n- **After:** below-floor and empty inputs are rejected; the exact 8-byte boundary encrypts and restores successfully, with the existing weak-input warning.\n- Focused tests: `backup::tests::passphrase_floor_rejects_short_input_and_accepts_the_exact_boundary` and `backup::tests::weak_passphrases_are_warned_at_creation` passed.\n- `rustfmt --check --edition 2024 pkgs/id/src/backup.rs pkgs/id/src/commands/key.rs` and `git diff --check` passed.\n- Independent read-only review: no findings.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** narrow — backup creation API and CLI input validation.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1797099635&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8953&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8953&signature=643756a0777592d3c9aeb686a26f38988168049809158083cd13d26df0881bcc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8953?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
